{"4899300": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Cheminots", "steam_appid": 4899300, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play with friends to conduct the train at the end of the track while keeping satisfaction high.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Manage your ressource</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4899300/extras/b866d800567223f70fc5aa751ce62655.poster.avif?t=1788017533\" width=800 height=398 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4899300/extras/b866d800567223f70fc5aa751ce62655.webm?t=1788017533\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4899300/extras/b866d800567223f70fc5aa751ce62655.mp4?t=1788017533\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy and collect coal and water. Make sure to have enough until the next stop or you will be stranded.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Play with friends</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4899300/extras/6423a491edaf43c8e4c9058a302d4719.poster.avif?t=1788017533\" width=800 height=398 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4899300/extras/6423a491edaf43c8e4c9058a302d4719.webm?t=1788017533\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4899300/extras/6423a491edaf43c8e4c9058a302d4719.mp4?t=1788017533\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cheminots is a co-op adventure for up to 5 players. Share task and try to not sabotage each other.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Take care of your passengers</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4899300/extras/6193980e5332eb699d03627c73a27fb0.poster.avif?t=1788017533\" width=800 height=398 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4899300/extras/6193980e5332eb699d03627c73a27fb0.webm?t=1788017533\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4899300/extras/6193980e5332eb699d03627c73a27fb0.mp4?t=1788017533\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Check valid transport papers. Discover weird new passengers. Take care of their needs with specialized wagons.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Drive the train</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4899300/extras/dec48f8aceb3b0efc8cc04443d64edd2.avif?t=1788017533\" width=512 height=512 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fuel the engine with coal and be aware of the different needs to keep a good speed.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Buy toys to play with</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4899300/extras/131ddeb174a16b4d99617a32aaa2718e.poster.avif?t=1788017533\" width=800 height=398 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4899300/extras/131ddeb174a16b4d99617a32aaa2718e.webm?t=1788017533\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4899300/extras/131ddeb174a16b4d99617a32aaa2718e.mp4?t=1788017533\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_pa